---
---

<div 
  class="cookie-banner" 
  id="cookie-banner"
  x-data="{ show: false }" 
  x-init="show = !localStorage.getItem('camargotech_cookies')"
  x-show="show" 
  x-transition:enter="transition ease-out duration-300"
  x-transition:enter-start="opacity-0 translate-y-8"
  x-transition:enter-end="opacity-100 translate-y-0"
  x-cloak
>
  <div class="container banner-inner">
    <div class="banner-text">
      <div class="banner-icon">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <path d="M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 10 10 4 4 0 0 1-5-5 4 4 0 0 1-5-5"></path>
          <path d="M8.5 8.5v.01"></path>
          <path d="M16 15.5v.01"></path>
          <path d="M12 12v.01"></path>
          <path d="M11 17v.01"></path>
          <path d="M7 13v.01"></path>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <strong>Privacidade e Cookies (LGPD)</strong>
        <p>A CamargoTech utiliza cookies técnicos essenciais para aprimorar sua experiência e garantir o funcionamento correto de orçamentos e do tema visual. Conheça nossa <a href="/politica-privacidade" class="cookie-link">Política de Privacidade</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="banner-actions">
      <button 
        type="button" 
        class="btn btn-primary btn-sm"
        @click="localStorage.setItem('camargotech_cookies', 'accepted'); show = false;"
      >
        Aceitar Todos
      </button>
      <button 
        type="button" 
        class="btn btn-outline btn-sm"
        @click="localStorage.setItem('camargotech_cookies', 'essential'); show = false;"
      >
        Apenas Essenciais
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .cookie-banner {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 1.5rem;
    left: 1.5rem;
    right: 1.5rem;
    z-index: 990;
    background: var(--ct-surface-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--ct-border);
    border-radius: var(--ct-radius-md);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
    padding: 1.25rem 1.75rem;
  }

  .banner-inner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .banner-text {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.925rem;
    color: var(--ct-text-muted);
  }

  .banner-text strong {
    color: var(--ct-text-main);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }

  .banner-icon {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(255, 107, 26, 0.15);
    color: var(--ct-orange-400);
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .cookie-link {
    color: var(--ct-orange-400);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .banner-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .btn-sm {
    padding: 0.55rem 1.15rem;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .banner-inner {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }
    .banner-actions {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: flex-end;
    }
  }
</style>
